{"4932350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Watch The Edge Honey!", "steam_appid": 4932350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/b2cb14dfaa4baee92e95bc4e61e2a724.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=1170 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/b2cb14dfaa4baee92e95bc4e61e2a724.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/b2cb14dfaa4baee92e95bc4e61e2a724.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/8a6eaf01ad9d600f6a78319625feb360.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/8a6eaf01ad9d600f6a78319625feb360.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/8a6eaf01ad9d600f6a78319625feb360.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;You are such a good person... I know you will overcome this path with me. No matter how high or how difficult it gets, you won't give up. We will join hands and return to our sweet home, together. Come on, start climbing... I am Eva. You're going to help me, aren't you? Watch the edge, honey...&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone on this uncanny path leading upward. Eva  the owner of that sweet, soft voice echoing constantly in your mind — is your only guide through this vertical world. She has one desire: to escape this bottomless pit and return home, above the clouds. And you are the one who will carry her there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch The Edge, Honey!</strong> is a psychological thriller wrapped in a vertical climbing adventure, built to test your nerves as much as your reflexes. As you climb under Eva's guidance, you'll fight gravity, your fear of heights, and  most of all the quiet, manipulative pressure she plants in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: a single wrong step sends you meters back down. Eva is always watching. Always guiding. Always whispering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/2c256992a26b0572b1ee5766fbb41461.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/2c256992a26b0572b1ee5766fbb41461.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/2c256992a26b0572b1ee5766fbb41461.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise and Challenging Parkour</strong> — One misstep sends you all the way back to where you started. Battle gravity with nothing but your reflexes and your patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Uncanny Atmosphere</strong> — The higher you climb, the more the visuals glitch, the environment warps, and the code itself begins to decay. It's as if the game doesn't want you here... or perhaps the heights want you a little too much.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warm Bond With Eva</strong> — On this lonely climb, Eva's sweet, endearing voice becomes your greatest motivation. Carrying her to the top slowly becomes something far deeper than simply beating a game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual Save Points</strong> — There are no autosaves, no checkpoints. You must manually save at specific points along the way. Save in the wrong spot, and a single mistake can erase hours of progress in an instant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch The Edge</strong> — Below you lies an endless void. Whatever happens, don't look back — just keep climbing. Because this road doesn't lead anywhere you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> — Think you’re fast? Test your skills, optimize your routes, and race against the clock! Track your best times and push your limits to the edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Mode</strong> — Want to explore the world without the fear? Peaceful Mode removes horror elements, jump scares, and intense threats so you can enjoy the environment and atmosphere at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual &amp; Easy Modes</strong> — Tailored for a smoother, stress free experience. Play in Casual Mode to save your progress wherever and whenever you want, giving you total control over your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/1735c103bf5a2f655a4d5b68926ef41e.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/1735c103bf5a2f655a4d5b68926ef41e.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/1735c103bf5a2f655a4d5b68926ef41e.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insert the cassette. Put your headphones on. Trust Eva.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you reach the summit, everything changes but not every journey ends the way you expect. Watch the edge, because while the void below only resets you to the beginning... what waits at the top is far more terrifying than falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/b2cb14dfaa4baee92e95bc4e61e2a724.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=1170 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/b2cb14dfaa4baee92e95bc4e61e2a724.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/b2cb14dfaa4baee92e95bc4e61e2a724.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/8a6eaf01ad9d600f6a78319625feb360.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/8a6eaf01ad9d600f6a78319625feb360.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/8a6eaf01ad9d600f6a78319625feb360.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;You are such a good person... I know you will overcome this path with me. No matter how high or how difficult it gets, you won't give up. We will join hands and return to our sweet home, together. Come on, start climbing... I am Eva. You're going to help me, aren't you? Watch the edge, honey...&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone on this uncanny path leading upward. Eva  the owner of that sweet, soft voice echoing constantly in your mind — is your only guide through this vertical world. She has one desire: to escape this bottomless pit and return home, above the clouds. And you are the one who will carry her there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch The Edge, Honey!</strong> is a psychological thriller wrapped in a vertical climbing adventure, built to test your nerves as much as your reflexes. As you climb under Eva's guidance, you'll fight gravity, your fear of heights, and  most of all the quiet, manipulative pressure she plants in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: a single wrong step sends you meters back down. Eva is always watching. Always guiding. Always whispering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/2c256992a26b0572b1ee5766fbb41461.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/2c256992a26b0572b1ee5766fbb41461.webm?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/2c256992a26b0572b1ee5766fbb41461.mp4?t=1786967066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise and Challenging Parkour</strong> — One misstep sends you all the way back to where you started. Battle gravity with nothing but your reflexes and your patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Uncanny Atmosphere</strong> — The higher you climb, the more the visuals glitch, the environment warps, and the code itself begins to decay. It's as if the game doesn't want you here... or perhaps the heights want you a little too much.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warm Bond With Eva</strong> — On this lonely climb, Eva's sweet, endearing voice becomes your greatest motivation. Carrying her to the top slowly becomes something far deeper than simply beating a game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual Save Points</strong> — There are no autosaves, no checkpoints. You must manually save at specific points along the way. Save in the wrong spot, and a single mistake can erase hours of progress in an instant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch The Edge</strong> — Below you lies an endless void. Whatever happens, don't look back — just keep climbing. Because this road doesn't lead anywhere you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> — Think you’re fast? Test your skills, optimize your routes, and race against the clock! Track your best times and push your limits to the edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Mode</strong> — Want to explore the world without the fear? Peaceful Mode removes horror elements, jump scares, and intense threats so you can enjoy the environment and atmosphere at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual &amp; Easy Modes</strong> — Tailored for a smoother, stress free experience. Play in Casual Mode to save your progress wherever and whenever you want, giving you total control over your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932350/extras/1735c103bf5a2f655a4d5b68926ef41e.poster.avif?t=1786967066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati